      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "お前だって信念を持って戦ってる。\r\nそのために武器が必要だと思ったんだろ？",
        "official_en": "Nothing wrong with that. You’ve got a cause of your own. That’s why you asked for her help in the first place.",
        "real_en": null
      },
