      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "アイリーンが武器を作るときに\r\n大切にしているものがわかった気がする。",
        "official_en": "I think I know what drives Aileen to create such great weapons.",
        "real_en": "I think I understand what matters to Aileen when she makes weapons."
      },
      "review": {
